			<div class="content" id="post-content-2753362">
									

<p>You know that feeling when you are sure that you've jumped to the right conclusion, but no-one believes you? How often are you wrong? How often are you right?</p>
<p>I hope you enjoy reading this. It falls roughly into <a href="/the-gulf">the Gulf</a> Canon, so my apologies to writers in that canon if I've messed up any plans you had. It also ties together at least 5 skips, including 3 of mine, and those of Marcuse and Kate McTiriss.</p>
<p>Thanks very much to tretter, Bluemorpho, Shio, DrMagnus and dankaar for their thoughts and feedback. In particular to tretter for some good thoughts about the style - sorry that we didn't get to discuss them further, but I really wanted to steal this slot if I could! And sorry djkaktus for throwing a reference to your Director Aktus without asking!</p>

