			<div class="content" id="post-content-2755523">
									

<blockquote>
<p>if the anomaly is focussed so narrowly</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I don't know if you intended to double the s; this seems like it could've been an intentional choice, though I feel safer just putting it here in case you didn't know.</p>
<p>I liked this. It was a short, entertaining thrill ride. I thought you were going to take it in a darker direction at the mention of internal segregation of Catholic personnel, but then it continued on as a fully comedic piece, which I think was probably the best decision you could've made. Showing the gradual progression of the site's personnel into a deeper state of naive paranoia was amusing. Presentation was almost universally excellent, and clinical tone was spot-on.</p>
<p>Very little else to add. It's a quick burst of fun that's good at what it does.</p>

